OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening with just the odd passing
OL,7,Fshower. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be dry. Westerly winds easing
OL,9,Fdown, but remaining fresh along the
OL,10,Fnorth coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,13,Fspread east during the morning,
OL,14,Fturning light and patchy from the west
OL,15,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
