OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with bright spells on Saturday,
OL,7,Fthe odd passing shower in the north.
OL,8,FDry at first on Sunday, rain spreading
OL,9,Feast later. Dry, warmer with bright
OL,10,Fspells on Monday.
